#!name=QX Rewrite Probe
#!desc=QX 重写能力探测：验证 script-request-header 是否支持 url/path、script-response-header 改状态码、请求响应脚本共享数据。所有探测目标都指向局域网地址 192.168.50.3:18765。配合 qx-rewrite-probe-server.mjs 使用。
#!homepage=https://github.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules
#!author=DemoJameson
#!updatedTime=2026-10-24 19:40:00

# [P1] script-response-header 是否支持改状态码 + 加头（192.168.50.3:18765/status）
^https?:\/\/127\.0\.0\.1:18765\/status(?:\?.*)?$ url script-response-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js?mode=status

# [P2] script-request-header 返回 { url }（跨域改写是否被支持/半套用；目标 httpbin.org 仅在启用的瞬间被访问）
^https?:\/\/127\.0\.0\.1:18765\/url(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js?mode=url&target=https%3A%2F%2Fhttpbin.org%2Fget%3Fprobe%3Durl

# [P3] script-request-header 返回 { path }（官方支持的形态是否生效）
^https?:\/\/127\.0\.0\.1:18765\/path(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js?mode=path&target=%2Fecho%3Fprobe%3Dpath

# [P4] 请求阶段记录 $request 真实内容
^https?:\/\/127\.0\.0\.1:18765\/echo(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js?mode=url-echo

# [P4] 响应阶段回读请求阶段记录
^https?:\/\/127\.0\.0\.1:18765\/echo(?:\?.*)?$ url script-response-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DemoJameson/Proxy.Modules/refs/heads/codex/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe/qx-rewrite-probe.js?mode=sync
